# The real notes database and theme map are the owner's unpublished
# material. They reach the image from the working directory, never from
# git; smoke.sh and CI fail if either is ever tracked. data/sample.sql and
# data/sample-theme-map.md are invented. The two .jsonl files are the old
# export's, gone with tools/export.py, and ignored while a copy lingers.
data/notes.sqlite
data/notes.sqlite-*
data/theme-map.md
data/notes.jsonl
data/themes.jsonl
smoke.jar

# serve.sh's settings for this machine: where the notes live, and a local
# password. smoke.sh and CI fail if it is ever tracked.
.env.local
